ready green per the prior verifier; my edits add no `any`/`var`/console and no boundary-crossing imports).\\n- **Fail-closed CLI stub contract preserved** — no edits to `src/cli/**` or domain stubs.\\n- **Discriminated-union compile-time proof preserved** — same `@ts-expect-error` assertion, just repositioned so it compiles and still proves an invalid kind/payload pairing needs an explicit cast.\\n\\n**Blocked on execution (your call):**\\n- `scripts/fc07-gate-self-test.mjs` is ready. It runs the real gates against real sacrificial files, writes the proof to `docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/00-foundation/fc-07-gate-self-test.md`, and restores `red-manifest.json` + removes the sacrificial files via `finally`.\\n\\n## To finish — one command, from `packages/lhc`:\\n\\n```\\nnode scripts/fc07-gate-self-test.mjs\\n```\\n\\nA correct run prints five `[OK ]` legs and `FC-0.7 GATE SELF-TEST: PASS`:\\n1. Baseline `verify` → exit 0 (confirms the typecheck fix)\\n2. failing test → `verify` exit non-zero\\n3. unchanged Red file → `green-verify` exit 0 (gate is discriminating)\\n4. edited Red file → `green-verify` non-zero with `test-immutability FAILED`\\n5. clean `verify-all` → exit 0\\n\\nIf you'd rather I run it, re-enable execution for this session (or tell me to allowlist `pnpm`/`node` in settings) and I'll run it, confirm both gates fail correctly, and tie off the recorded artifact.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":4737,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":134670,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":4737},\"output_tokens\":6,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"7d47137f-cd86-4c15-bbf8-4a8dc794929e\",\"uuid\":\"7c4b2427-e9ac-4b2c-a7c9-2318c5475008\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cbuc4JbmK8fYqvSSTGqVy\"}